NOTE ON MODELS AND TRAINING DATA

This licence covers the SpeakTwin source code only. Models you train and the
corpora you train them on carry their own terms, and a model generally
inherits the restrictions of its training data.

Several corpora referenced by scripts/datasets.py are non-commercial
(PodcastFillers, TED-LIUM 3, RAVDESS, IEMOCAP, MSP-Podcast). If you intend to
use SpeakTwin commercially, train only on CC0 / CC BY sources — Common Voice,
VoxPopuli, AMI, speechocean762, LibriSpeech. See DATASETS.md for the full
licence table.
